 "titulo": "I came home. It had been eleven days 😱 Part 3 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "ELEVEN DAYS LATER",
 "descripcion": "Nora walked toward the drum, all night, along the tracks. When her phone came back, the date was wrong. The end of Harlow Station.\n\nWould you have stayed with the man?\n\nNarrated fiction. New story every week.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "I chose the drum, and walked along the tracks.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The rails were rusty, like no train had passed in years.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Behind me, the man kept calling my name. Softer each time.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I didn't turn around. I don't think he could leave that platform.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "After an hour, a crossing light, and a bell.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The drum stopped the moment I reached it.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then a car stopped. A stranger offered me a ride.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "He knew my name too. He said: your sister sent me.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I said no, and kept walking.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The car followed me, lights off, for a mile. Then it was gone.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 5:12, the lights of a real gas station.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "The clerk dropped his coffee when I walked in.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "My phone came back on. It had been eleven days.",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "My face was on a poster by the door.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "My sister reported me missing the first night.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And those texts? She never sent them.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  }
 ],
